00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:27.927 line:0%
<i> NARRATOR: ANTARCTICA.</i>

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:30.629 line:0%
<i> IT'S THE LEAST EXPLORED,</i>

00:00:30.729 --> 00:00:35.268 line:0%
<i> LEAST UNDERSTOOD
 CONTINENT ON EARTH.</i>

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.744 line:0%
<i> IN WINTER,
 THE SUN NEVER RISES.</i>

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:48.380 line:0%
<i> IN SUMMER,
 IT NEVER SETS.</i>

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:52.751 line:0%
<i> 5.4 MILLION SQUARE
 MILES OF FROZEN DESERT,</i>

00:00:52.851 --> 00:00:56.656 line:0%
<i> HOME TO THE
 DRIEST PLACE ON EARTH.</i>

00:00:57.056 --> 00:01:01.861 line:0%
<i> AVERAGE WINTER TEMPERATURE:
 20 TO 90 BELOW.</i>

